  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it's translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped potatoes and cook for 5 minutes, until they start to brown.",
    "Transfer the potato mixture to a bamboo tray and arrange the potatoes in a single layer.",
    "Drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle with shredded Manchego cheese.",
    "Transfer the bamboo tray to the oven and bake at 400°F (200°C) for 15-20 minutes, until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove from the oven and sprinkle with red pepper flakes, if using.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro, if desired."
